      <![CDATA[<h2 id="0x0-前言"><a class="header-anchor" href="#0x0-前言"></a>0x0. 前言</h2><p>旧 MBP 2018 上搞了个 NixOS，用着很爽，但只是个玩具。<br>现有一台 MBP 2019，装了 nix-darwin，以为会很爽，但是吃了许多坑：</p><ul class="lvl-0"><li class="lvl-2"><p>各种 Nix runtime 的 installer 不支持 <code>x86_64-darwin</code>；</p></li><li class="lvl-2"><p><code>evaluation warning: Nixpkgs 26.05 will be the last release to support x86_64-darwin</code>。</p></li></ul><p>五月份的时候 <a href="https://github.com/nixos/nixpkgs/issues/522307">pipx 还没法 build 了</a>，虽然在 Unstable 里面已经修了这个锅，但是我是低贱的 26.05 用户。</p><p>这里记一下我如何修锅。</p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="0x1-补锅"><a class="header-anchor" href="#0x1-补锅"></a>0x1. 补锅</h2><details class="note danger"><summary><p>锅的样子</p></summary><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">evaluation warning: Nixpkgs 26.05 will be the last release to support x86_64-darwin; see https://nixos.org/manual/nixpkgs/unstable/release-notes#x86_64-darwin-26.05</span><br><span class="line">error: Cannot build &#x27;/nix/store/hsla5dwwa4hgy6m29b6crm3f9kxpl0zj-python3.13-pipx-1.8.0.drv&#x27;.</span><br><span class="line">       Reason: builder failed with exit code 1.</span><br><span class="line">       Output paths:</span><br><span class="line">         /nix/store/0vmvrb9phq8nh2zji0w485i1j6vfagxs-python3.13-pipx-1.8.0</span><br><span class="line">         /nix/store/wny7vj9qb6if9sxf2hjp7g3bwy9naq27-python3.13-pipx-1.8.0-dist</span><br><span class="line">       Last 25 log lines:</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; E             - my-project[cli]@ git+ssh://git@bitbucket.org/my-company/myproject.git</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; E             + my-project[cli] @ git+ssh://git@bitbucket.org/my-company/myproject.git</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; E             ?                +</span><br><span class="line">       &gt;</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; tests/test_package_specifier.py:118: AssertionError</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; ----------------------------- Captured stderr call -----------------------------</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; pipx &gt;(_parsed_package_to_package_or_url:119): ⚠️  Ignoring environment markers (python_version &lt; &quot;3.8&quot;) in package</span><br><span class="line">       &gt;     specification. Use pipx options to specify this type of information.</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; pipx &gt;(_parsed_package_to_package_or_url:139): cleaned package spec: my-project[cli] @ git+ssh://git@bitbucket.org/my-company/myproject.git</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; ------------------------------ Captured log call -------------------------------</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; WARNING  pipx.package_specifier:package_specifier.py:119 ⚠️  Ignoring environment markers (python_version &lt; &quot;3.8&quot;) in package</span><br><span class="line">       &gt;     specification. Use pipx options to specify this type of information.</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; INFO     pipx.package_specifier:package_specifier.py:139 cleaned package spec: my-project[cli] @ git+ssh://git@bitbucket.org/my-company/myproject.git</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; =========================== short test summary info ============================</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; SKIPPED [2] tests/test_interpreter.py:23: Looks for Python.exe</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; SKIPPED [2] tests/test_interpreter.py:41: Looks for Python.exe</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; SKIPPED [2] tests/test_interpreter.py:59: Looks for Python.exe</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; FAILED tests/test_package_specifier.py::test_fix_package_name[nox@https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip-black-black@ https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip] - AssertionError: assert &#x27;black @ http...ve/18.9b0.zip&#x27; == &#x27;black@ https...ve...</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; FAILED tests/test_package_specifier.py::test_fix_package_name[nox[extra]@https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip-black-black[extra]@ https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip] - AssertionError: assert &#x27;black[extra]...ve/18.9b0.zip&#x27; == &#x27;black[extra]...ve...</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; FAILED tests/test_package_specifier.py::test_parse_specifier_for_metadata[nox@git+https://github.com/cs01/nox.git@5ea70723e9e6-nox@ git+https://github.com/cs01/nox.git@5ea70723e9e6-True] - AssertionError: assert &#x27;nox @ git+ht...@5ea70723e9e6&#x27; == &#x27;nox@ git+htt...@5...</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; FAILED tests/test_package_specifier.py::test_parse_specifier_for_metadata[black@https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip-black@ https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip-True] - AssertionError: assert &#x27;black @ http...ve/18.9b0.zip&#x27; == &#x27;black@ https...ve...</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; FAILED tests/test_package_specifier.py::test_parse_specifier_for_metadata[black @ https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip-black@ https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip-True] - AssertionError: assert &#x27;black @ http...ve/18.9b0.zip&#x27; == &#x27;black@ https...ve...</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; FAILED tests/test_package_specifier.py::test_parse_specifier_for_metadata[black[extra] @ https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip-black[extra]@ https://github.com/ambv/black/archive/18.9b0.zip-True] - AssertionError: assert &#x27;black[extra]...ve/18.9b0.zip&#x27; == &#x27;black[extra]...ve...</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; FAILED tests/test_package_specifier.py::test_parse_specifier_for_metadata[my-project[cli] @ git+ssh://git@bitbucket.org/my-company/myproject.git ; python_version&lt;&quot;3.8&quot;-my-project[cli]@ git+ssh://git@bitbucket.org/my-company/myproject.git-True] - AssertionError: assert &#x27;my-project[c...myproject.git&#x27; == &#x27;my-project[c...my...</span><br><span class="line">       &gt; =========== 7 failed, 78 passed, 6 skipped, 265 deselected in 14.11s ===========</span><br><span class="line">       For full logs, run:</span><br><span class="line">         nix log /nix/store/hsla5dwwa4hgy6m29b6crm3f9kxpl0zj-python3.13-pipx-1.8.0.drv</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></details><p>发现是 <code>test_fix_package_name</code> 和 <code>test_parse_specifier_for_metadata</code> 这两个 tests failed，于是：</p><figure class="highlight nix"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="params">final:</span> <span class="params">prev:</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">pipx</span> <span class="operator">=</span> prev.pipx.overridePythonAttrs (<span class="params">oldAttrs:</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">disabledTests</span> <span class="operator">=</span></span><br><span class="line">      (oldAttrs.disabledTests <span class="keyword">or</span> [])</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="operator">++</span> [</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">&quot;test_fix_package_name&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">&quot;test_parse_specifier_for_metadata&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">      ];</span><br><span class="line">  &#125;);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后 rebuild 就好了。</p><p>草台班子。</p>]]>
    </content>
